Package: CRIO
Type: Package
Title: Risk and Gap Analysis for the CGIAR Research Investment Opportunities Report
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    c(person(given = "Abhijeet",
             family = "Mishra",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "A.Mishra@cgiar.org",
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-8287-9922")),
      person(given = "Claude",
             role = "aut",
             comment = "AI coding assistant (Anthropic)"))
Description: Reads IMPACT model scenario results (via GFSir) and builds the
    risk and gap analysis used in the Research Investment Opportunities (RIO)
    report: hunger, diet, nutrient adequacy and blue water indicators against
    targets; pathway analysis across socioeconomic and climate scenarios;
    maps, target trajectories and comparisons of Breeding For Tomorrow (B4T)
    scenarios against the baseline.
